    /// Request an investor qualification status
    ///
    /// Multipart form: `request` is a JSON `KycQualificationRequest` (the web app sends it as a
    /// part with content type `application/json`) and `files` the supporting documents,
    /// repeated once per file. Qualified investors tick at least 2 criteria, highly qualified
    /// at least one per block
