    /// Start a registration
    ///
    /// First step of sign-up. Requires a solved slider captcha in the `captcha` header (see
    /// `GET /api/v1/captcha/generate`) and, in the web app, a Google reCAPTCHA v3 token (action
    /// `registration_client`) in the `recaptcha` header. On success the server emails a code:
    /// continue with `verify_email`, then `send_phone_code` / `verify_phone` while the status
    /// is `PENDING_PHONE`, then `complete`, then sign in with the password. Errors:
    /// `USER_EXISTS` (409), `INVALID_EMAIL`, `INVALID_PASSWORD`, `INVALID_AGREEMENT`,
    /// `BAD_REQUEST` (invalid phone), `PHONE_NUMBER_NOT_AVAILABLE` (400), `INVALID_RECAPTCHA`
    /// (403), `INVALID_CAPTCHA`.
    ///
    /// `POST /api/v1/registration/initiate`
    ///
    /// **Experimental:** the endpoint may change without notice.
    /// Public: works without signing in.
    ///
    /// # Errors
