    /// code with this operation, confirm it with `verify_code`, then repeat the refused request
    /// unchanged. The web app sends an empty JSON object, allows 2 resends (30 s apart, codes
    /// valid 2 minutes) and 3 wrong codes. `SMS_VERIFICATION_FAILED` means the user is blocked
    /// and must contact support; `SMS_SENDING_ERROR` is a delivery failure.
